		"1.20.1-2.1.37":"- Dropped support for Minecraft 1.20\r\n- Updated Forge to version 47.1.1\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.106.1\r\n- Updated JEI to version 15.2.0.23\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.20.1-81\r\n- Re-enabled Patchouli compat\r\n- Bumped version to 2.1.37"
