		"1.21.1-2.4.11":"- Reset shader colour after paint a solid rect / triangle. Closes ER #172\r\n- Added back Patchouli support\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-87\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.11"
		,
		"1.21.1-2.4.13":"- (Neo)Forge has an issue where it provides incorrect, empty ModelData when fall damage particles are requested for ModelData-aware blocks (see https://github.com/neoforged/NeoForge/issues/1629). To address this, a fallback ModelData option has been added, which will be used in cases where the requested ModelData returns empty.\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.13"
