        "1.19-2.0.52":"- Added back support for Mekanism\r\n- Updated Forge to version 41.0.98\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 10.3.0.467\r\n- Updated JEI to version 11.0.0.211\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.19-74\r\n- Updated ZeroCore version to 2.1.23\r\n- Bumped version to 2.0.52"
