        "1.21.1-2.4.6":"- Add missing tags for ores, ingots and storage blocks. Closes #157\r\n- Switched from IGasHandler to the new IChemicalHandler capability of Mekanism 1.21.1. Closes #162\r\n- Fix Reactor Creative Water generator valid block\r\n- Fix Turbine Creative Steam generator valid blocks\r\n- Updated Minecraft to version 1.21.1\r\n- Updated NeoForge to version 21.1.22\r\n- Updated CC:Tweaked to version 1.113.0\r\n- Updated JEI to version 19.9.0.122\r\n- Updated Mekanism to version 1.21.1-10.7.0.55\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.2\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.6"
		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.7":"- Fix crash with sodium 0.6.0-beta.1. Closes #163\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.3\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.7"
		,
