		,
        "1.21.1-2.4.11":"- Fix loading of er_gui_theme.json. Closes #172\r\n- Added back Patchouli support\r\n- Book: added a section for the Energizer and a new introductory text\r\n- Book: refined the old pages a bit\r\n- Updated Patchouli to version 1.21-87\r\n- Updated ZeroCore to version 2.4.11\r\n- Bumped version to 2.4.11"
